103:As with any Python function, you can pass arguments to a flow, including both positional and keyword arguments.
104:These arguments defined on your flow function are called **parameters**.
111:Similarly, when invoking a flow run from a [deployment](/v3/how-to-guides/deployments/create-deployments/), Prefect will attempt to coerce provided parameters to the parameter schema implied by your flow function's type signature
199:However, if you put all your code in a single flow function and any line of code fails, the entire flow fails and must be retried from the beginning.
